@startuml Statistics - Simplified
!theme plain
skinparam BoxPadding 5
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Controller
participant Service
participant Repository
database PostgreSQL

User -> Frontend: Open dashboard
Frontend -> Controller: GET /statistics

Controller -> Service: getPhotoStatistics()

== Data ophalen ==
Service -> Repository: findAll()
Repository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM photos
PostgreSQL --> Repository: List<Photo>
Repository --> Service: allPhotos

alt Geen foto's
    Service -> Service: createEmptyStatistics()
    Service --> Controller: Lege statistieken
else Foto's gevonden

    == Berekeningen ==
    Service -> Service: Camera usage (groeperen)
    Service -> Service: Lens usage (groeperen)
    Service -> Service: ISO/Aperture distributie
    Service -> Service: GPS analyse
    Service -> Service: Upload trends
    Service -> Service: Genereer inzichten
    Service -> Service: Genereer aanbevelingen

    Service --> Controller: PhotoStatisticsDto
end

Controller --> Frontend: 200 OK + JSON
Frontend --> User: Dashboard met grafieken

@enduml
@startuml Photo Upload - Simplified
!theme plain
skinparam BoxPadding 5
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

actor User
participant Frontend
participant Controller
participant Service
participant Repository
database PostgreSQL
database "File System" as FS

User -> Frontend: Upload foto
Frontend -> Controller: POST /photos/upload

== Validatie ==
Controller -> Controller: Check bestand
alt Ongeldig
    Controller --> Frontend: 400 Bad Request
    Frontend --> User: Foutmelding
else Geldig
    Controller -> Service: savePhoto(file)

    == Metadata & Processing ==
    Service -> Service: Extract EXIF metadata
    Service -> Service: RAW detectie

    alt RAW format
        Service -> Service: Probeer preview (3x)
        alt Mislukt
            Service -> Service: Placeholder image
        end
    end

    Service -> Service: Resize & compress\n(max 2560px, JPEG 92%)

    == Opslag ==
    Service -> FS: Opslaan (UUID naam)
    Service -> Repository: Save metadata
    Repository -> PostgreSQL: INSERT photo

    Service --> Controller: Success
    Controller --> Frontend: 200 OK + details
    Frontend --> User: Foto in galerij
end

@enduml

